EmailTemplate.textOnly:
Hello {!Contact.FirstName},

As your personal admission counselor, I am so glad you were able to join us at More to Explore. I am interested to know what you thought of the event. Which session did you enjoy the most? What were you most excited about or surprised to learn while on campus?

Do you have any questions that were not answered at the event or that you’ve thought of since More to Explore?

I'm a personal resource for you, so please contact me if you have any questions. I hope to hear from you soon, and we look forward to seeing you in the fall semester.

Go Devils!

{!User.Recruiter_Full_Name__c}
{!User.Recruiter_Title__c}
Admission Services
{!User.Recruiter_Email__c}
{!User.Recruiter_Phone__c}

If you have any additional information or questions related to this, please reply to this email.

